  },
  {
   "kind": "excerpt",
   "volumeId": "frus1952-54v13p1",
   "documentId": "d116",
   "text": "Since many new customs FE can be traced to Amer films, must be assumed that films is effective program though difficult to determine degree."
  },
  {
   "kind": "excerpt",
   "volumeId": "frus1952-54v13p1",
   "documentId": "d116",
   "text": "All factors recited must be viewed as effective though degree cannot be accurately measured."
